  "You Will Also Love": "Dit vind je vast ook mooi",
  "✨ Smooth All Over, Instantly": "✨ Direct overal glad",
  "💦 Bathroom Breaks Made Easy": "💦 Makkelijk naar het toilet",
  "🤍 Held In, Never Squeezed": "🤍 Gevormd, nooit ingesnoerd",
